      "@type": "cat-harness:Tool",
      "description": "Check authored L1 (`*.l1.yaml`, the measles pattern) for a source with no usable text layer: each statement must be verbatim in the image narrative (`images.json`) or the `transcription` block it names, every transcription word (digits aside) must be corroborated by the entry's text layer unless listed under `inspectionOnly`, and keys must be unique.",
      "install": {
        "none": true
      },
